{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/entertainment/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115190201792-1115_00862_001_01p.jpg?20261115193911\"/><p>TVB上位小生吳偉豪出身小康之家，近日他罕有拍片分享家中大屋，令超巨型後花園曝光。片中他以白色T恤、黑色短褲配波鞋，一身貼地「街坊裝」出鏡，在大屋外的後花園打理，見走廊及牆頭擺滿密密麻麻的盆栽，數量多得驚人，吳偉豪則逐一照料，先提起大水桶，再用小膠杯舀水，逐盆盆栽淋水，盡顯細心一面。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:02.072899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:02:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:29.771847+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:29.771847+00:00","content_hash":"adfb375291cd69a1ca9d4f0377d054ca6a38030359fafa0805df24b5520d8466","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}